{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15301810","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15301810","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1530181001:1":{"text":"Yeah, don't worry too much. Bitter Cling is a natural fighter and hunter. Have a little faith in him.","source_cn":"是啊，你也别太担心了。巴辛确实很有打斗和捕猎的天赋，对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A32FAA4C1739CE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530181002:1":{"text":"Besides, the Hunting Goddess is with him. With her blessing, the Halians can't touch him.","source_cn":"再说，还有狩猎神大人呢！有了神的加护，呼临人伤不到他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DF556DDF80282FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530181003:1":{"text":"But he isn't a warrior! How can I not worry?","source_cn":"但他不是战士！我怎么能不担心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC91B761B343B383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530181004:1":{"text":"Hunting Goddess, please... let Bitter Cling return to me alive.","source_cn":"狩猎神大人，请您保佑巴辛能平安回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD61FA0A447F86C69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兽人黑尾":{"text":"Dark Tail","source":"兽人黑尾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:兽人流":{"text":"Flow","source":"兽人流","status":"matc